WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.280
I wish someone would have told me this sooner, you can now run cloud code for free.

00:03.280 --> 00:06.480
Step 1, go to the skitab repo, install your V and this proxy.

00:06.480 --> 00:09.280
Then go to build.nv.com and get your API key.

00:09.280 --> 00:11.920
Nvidia gives you 40 lm calls per minute for free.

00:11.920 --> 00:13.840
Then go ahead and open two terminals.

00:13.840 --> 00:16.560
Configure the proxy in one and plot code in the other.

00:16.560 --> 00:18.240
It will allow and you got cloud code for free.

00:18.240 --> 00:21.200
I put together a free setup guide, comment in video and I will share it with you.

00:21.200 --> 00:22.160
Follow for more tips.

